
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>ArtistryHub - Artist Portfolio</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:Arial;margin:0;background:#f8f5f1;color:#333}
header{background:#30233e;color:white;padding:25px;text-align:center}
nav{background:#493455;padding:15px;text-align:center}
nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none;margin:15px}
section{padding:25px;text-align:center}
.container{max-width:950px;margin:20px auto;background:white;padding:20px;border-radius:10px}
.gallery{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:15px}
.art{background:#f0e9f4;padding:20px;width:220px;border-radius:10px}
.art img{width:100%;height:130px;object-fit:cover}
button{background:#684477;color:white;border:0;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer}
input,textarea{padding:10px;margin:8px;width:90%;border:1px solid #ccc}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>ArtistryHub</h1>
<p>Celebrating the Artistic Journey of Emily Harris</p>
</header>

<nav>
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#about">About</a>
<a href="#portfolio">Portfolio</a>
<a href="#media">Media</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<section id="home">
<h2>Welcome to My Creative World</h2>
<p>Discover creativity, imagination and beautiful artworks.</p>
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541961017774-22349e4a1262?w=700" width="70%" height="260" style="object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px">
</section>

<div class="container" id="about">
<h2>About the Artist</h2>
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?w=300" width="160" style="border-radius:50%">
<h3>Emily Harris</h3>
<p>Emily Harris is a passionate artist who creates beautiful paintings inspired by nature, culture and everyday life. Her artistic journey focuses on creativity and expression.</p>
</div>

<div class="container" id="portfolio">
<h2>My Portfolio</h2>
<div class="gallery">
<div class="art">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579783902614-a3fb3927b6a5?w=400">
<h3>Modern Art</h3><p>Creative modern painting.</p>
</div>
<div class="art">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1549887534-1541e9326642?w=400">
<h3>Nature Art</h3><p>Inspired by nature.</p>
</div>
<div class="art">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1577083552431-6e5fd01aa342?w=400">
<h3>Abstract Art</h3><p>Colorful abstract design.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="container">
<h2>Discography / Bibliography</h2>
<p>2023 - Creative Expressions</p>
<p>2024 - Colors of Nature</p>
<p>2025 - Modern Art Collection</p>
</div>

<div class="container" id="media">
<h2>Media Gallery</h2>
<p>Explore artist exhibitions, interviews and creative events.</p>
<iframe width="80%" height="250" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ScMzIvxBSi4" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</div>

<div class="container">
<h2>News and Updates</h2>
<p>Upcoming Art Exhibition - December 2026</p>
<p>New collection coming soon!</p>
</div>

<div class="container" id="contact">
<h2>Contact Artist</h2>
<input id="visitor" placeholder="Your Name">
<input id="visitorEmail" placeholder="Email">
<textarea id="message" placeholder="Your Message"></textarea>
<button onclick="sendMessage()">Send Message</button>
<p id="msg"></p>
</div>

<script>
function sendMessage(){
if(!visitor.value||!visitorEmail.value||!message.value){
alert("Please fill all fields");return;
}
msg.innerText="Thank you! Your message has been submitted.";
visitor.value="";
visitorEmail.value="";
message.value="";
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
